OL,3,AKing talks of 'most tragic of days
OL,4,Aimaginable' as he meets survivors of
OL,5,AAberfan disaster 60 years on
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a speech, the King described how
OL,8,F"very special" it is to be back in
OL,9,FAberfan, saying "today in our nation
OL,10,Fand across the world, thoughts will
OL,11,Fturn to you in in Aberfan
OL,13,FA prayer and moment of silence was held
OL,14,Fat 09:15 to mark the moment the coal
OL,15,Fspoil struck the village
